    {
      "key": "gg.ev.carbon_parts",
      "title": "Carbon Gun Parts",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "The pulse rifle, the PDW, the Tesla and Sonic rifles and every later energy weapon share three parts: a Carbon Barrel, a Carbon Receiver and a Carbon Gunstock. Build one of each and you can start on most of the tier.\n\nNone of them is true carbon: they are titanium with Epoxid Fiber Reinforced plates. The barrel uses a small titanium pipe and rings, the receiver is a hardened frame with titanium and epoxy plates, and the stock is epoxy and plastic with titanium screws. The Receiver also wants Mechanical Parts T3, made from titanium gears, springs and screws. NEI has all the numbers.\n\n[note]Mechanical Parts T3 are also needed by the Laser Rifle, the Exo Suit and the Anti Gravity Device, so make extras.[/note]",
      "pre": [
        "gg.ev.intro"
      ],
