      "key": "gg.ev.adv_ammo",
      "title": "Advanced Ammunition",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "Advanced bullets are the EV ammo step up: titanium-jacketed rounds with a little TNT in the load. The PDW and the Pulse Rifle shoot them from Advanced Magazines.\n\nMake the bullets in an EV Ammo Press from titanium foil, titanium rounds and a block of TNT. Build empty Advanced Magazines, then load them in the same machine, four at a time with three advanced bullets each. NEI will tell you the circuit that selects each recipe.\n\nThis quest asks for a loaded magazine, so you know the whole line works.",
