      "key": "gg.ev.pulse",
      "title": "Pulse Rifle or PDW",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "Two ballistic guns that eat advanced magazines. The Pulse Rifle adds a fire-control circuit to the build. The PDW is a compact personal defense weapon and needs no circuit. Build either one to move on.\n\nBoth are built in the EV Assembler from a Carbon Barrel, a Carbon Receiver and a Carbon Gunstock, plus titanium plates and screws. The Pulse Rifle adds a diamond lens, an EV circuit and soldering alloy; the PDW takes small titanium springs instead.\n\nNeither is an electric item, so they need no charger. The ammo is the work.",
