      "key": "gg.ev.exotics",
      "title": "Tesla or Sonic Rifle",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "Two specialist energy weapons: the Tesla Rifle is built around an emitter coil, and the Sonic Rifle fires focused sound. Pick whichever suits the job.\n\nBoth run on a full EV battery hull and charge only in an EV charger or battery buffer. The Tesla Rifle uses an EV emitter as its coil. The Sonic Rifle uses a Sonic Emitter, which you build in the Assembler from an EV emitter, an electric piston and Mechanical Parts T3. Each also takes a Carbon Receiver and Gunstock.\n\n[note]An HV buffer will not accept an EV item. Make sure you have an EV charger first.[/note]",
