      "key": "gg.ev.laser_focus",
      "title": "Laser Focus",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "The Laser Focus is the heart of every laser weapon: a ruby cut to a tight beam. Without it there is no Laser Barrel, and without a Laser Barrel there is no Laser Rifle.\n\nCut it in a GT Laser Engraver (EV) from a ruby and an EV emitter, with a white lens in the machine. The lens is not used up, but the emitter is. NEI shows the recipe if you press R on the focus.\n\n[note]A Laser Barrel is built later in the Assembler from the focus, a lens and electrum foil. Make a few at once.[/note]",
