      "key": "gg.ev.laser",
      "title": "Laser Rifle",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "No magazines, no brass, no reloading: the Laser Rifle runs on stored energy as long as you keep it charged. It is your first real energy weapon.\n\nBuild it in the EV Assembler from a Laser Barrel, a Hardened Receiver, a Plastic Gun Stock, Mechanical Parts T3, an EV circuit, a full EV battery hull and soldering alloy. It comes out uncharged, and you charge it in an EV charger or battery buffer. An HV buffer will not accept it.\n\n[note]The Laser Rifle is an IC2 electric item of tier 4. Check the tooltip for its charge.[/note]",
