      "key": "gg.ev.bio_culture",
      "title": "E. coli Culture",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "The Bio Gun runs on E. coli culture fluid, and the same fluid becomes a Plasma Membrane, a part you need for Cybernetic Parts. So this quest asks you to make the whole chain once and hand over the Cybernetic Parts.\n\nStart in the HV Bio Lab: an empty petri dish, a fermented spider eye and water make an E. coli dish. Put the dish in a BartWorks Bacterial Vat (EV) with Biomass and distilled water to grow culture fluid. An HV Centrifuge turns 1,000 mB of it into a Plasma Membrane.\n\nCraft Cybernetic Parts in the EV Assembler from fine electrum wire, EV circuits, plastic, redstone, soul sand and that membrane. Check NEI for the recipe.\n\n[note]You will fill the Bio Tank from the same fluid in the next quest.[/note]",
