      "key": "gg.ev.bio_gun",
      "title": "Bio Gun",
      "tier": "EV",
      "desc": "A gun that fires globs of biological culture. Its glob deals poison damage and leaves the target poisoned, unless the target wears full biological hazmat.\n\nBuild it in the EV Assembler from a Pump Mechanism, a Steel Receiver, a Plastic Gun Stock, a small titanium pipe, and titanium plates and screws. It comes out empty. Load a full Bio Tank and fire. The right button charges up for a stronger shot that costs more rounds.\n\n[note]Bio blobs on the ground need explosions.blockDamage enabled on the server. With it off, the glob still poisons targets but leaves no blobs.[/note]",
